de-code"}, {"title": "claude code release notes", "url": "https://claudelog.com/faqs/claude-code-release-notes"}, {"title": "• Tech Dev NotesTech Dev Notes", "url": "https://techdevnotes.com/releases/claude-code/2.1.231"}, {"title": "• Tech Dev NotesTech Dev Notes", "url": "https://techdevnotes.com/releases/claude-code/2.1.232"}, {"title": "• Tech Dev NotesTech Dev Notes", "url": "https://techdevnotes.com/releases/claude-code/2.1.168"}, {"title": "Remote OpenClaw Blog", "url": "https://www.remoteopenclaw.com/blog/claude-code-changelog"}, {"title": "Claude Code v1.0.1 → v2.1.310: what changed", "url": "https://www.havoptic.com/r/claude-code/diff?from=1.0.1&to=latest"}], "tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01VbmzfR4qoL2V27NfCWBWVa"}, "The search results don't agree on a single latest version, and most are third-party trackers rather than Anthropic's own changelog.\n\n- **Most recent date found:** One comparison page reports that 390 releases shipped between v1.0.1 (May 22, 2025) and v2.1.310 (October 23, 2026). That makes v2.1.310 the newest version I found, though I couldn't confirm it against the official page.\n- **Earlier figures:** A releases tracker lists v2.1.294 as latest, dated October 8, 2026. Other pages cite v2.1.207 (July 2026) and v2.1.215 (July 19, 2026), so those are likely stale.\n- **Official source:** The community summaries point to the official changelog at code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog, which is mirrored in the CHANGELOG.md file in the anthropics/claude-code GitHub repository.\n- **Checking locally:** Running `claude --version` shows the installed build, and `claude update` installs the newest one.\n\nBased on these results, v2.1.310 (October 23, 2026) is the most recent version referenced, but the official changelog is the authoritative check."], "searchCount": 1}, "type": "user", "uuid": "5e95145e-04d1-41d0-a708-4ca251351eef"}
